{"id":"d404f437f90ff5f6","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-consistency-statement.md","title":"Internal Consistency Sentence","display":"df-consistency-statement — Internal Consistency Sentence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-consistency-statement","aliases":["67-df-consistency-statement"],"display":"df-consistency-statement — Internal Consistency Sentence","depends_on":["[[67-df-formula]]","[[67-df-provability-predicate]]","[[67-df-godel-encoding]]"],"source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","verification_status":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"source_chapter":1,"source_label":"Con_sigma","source_printed_pages":"13–14","source_pdf_pages":"24–25","source_proof_status":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明","inherited_verification_status":"source-statement-checked","inherited_source_proof_status":"陈述及下述本地推导已复核；未作机器证明","machine_verified":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14","inherited_eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-consistency-statement"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-consistency-statement</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-consistency-statement — Internal Consistency Sentence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2035a1f4d72e7df9\" href=\"?note=2035a1f4d72e7df9\" title=\"67-df-formula\">67-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6a4c234306a0ec0c\" href=\"?note=6a4c234306a0ec0c\" title=\"67-df-provability-predicate\">67-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e5654af7c954e1c0\" href=\"?note=e5654af7c954e1c0\" title=\"67-df-godel-encoding\">67-df-godel-encoding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"source_label","html":"Con_sigma"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"13–14"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"24–25"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"陈述及下述本地推导已复核；未作机器证明"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"inherited_eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T(v)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T(v)\\)</span> 绑定同一有效呈示及表示公式，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6a4c234306a0ec0c\" href=\"?note=6a4c234306a0ec0c\" title=\"67-df-provability-predicate\">67-df-provability-predicate</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(\\bot)\">\\(g(\\bot)\\)</span> 是固定矛盾句 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\equiv\\neg(0=0)\">\\(\\bot\\equiv\\neg(0=0)\\)</span> 的编码，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e5654af7c954e1c0\" href=\"?note=e5654af7c954e1c0\" title=\"67-df-godel-encoding\">67-df-godel-encoding</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline{g(\\bot)}\">\\(\\overline{g(\\bot)}\\)</span> 是对象语言数词，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_T\\)</span> 是下式引入的对象语言句法对象。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{L_A}\">\\(v\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{L_A}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[v]\">\\(P\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[v]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P[\\bar n/v]\">\\(P[\\bar n/v]\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2035a1f4d72e7df9\" href=\"?note=2035a1f4d72e7df9\" title=\"67-df-formula\">67-df-formula</a> 的无捕获代入。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_g(P)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_g(P)\\)</span> 显式保留表示公式参数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_T\\)</span> 仅是固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T\\)</span> 后的简称。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_g(P)\\coloneqq\\neg P[\\overline{g(\\bot)}/v],\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Con}_T\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Con}_g(\\mathrm{Prov}_T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Con}_g(P)\\coloneqq\\neg P[\\overline{g(\\bot)}/v],\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Con}_T\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Con}_g(\\mathrm{Prov}_T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条的原书页码及既往核对记录继承自输入档案；本轮未提供原书 PDF，这些记录不表示本轮重新完成了来源或证明核验。</p>\n<p>原书 p.13 定义 Con_σ，并在 p.14 指出对公理集的 PR binumeration 的选择存在记号省略。本条保留呈示依赖。量词 ∀p∈ℕ 是元语言量化，不能放进一个号称对象语言的句子定义；外部一致性仍见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9f0e08fd1022847c\" href=\"?note=9f0e08fd1022847c\" title=\"67-df-consistent\">67-df-consistent</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2035a1f4d72e7df9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"6a4c234306a0ec0c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-godel-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"e5654af7c954e1c0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-godel-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"6a4c234306a0ec0c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T$ 和 $\\mathrm{Prov}_T(v)$ 绑定同一有效呈示及表示公式，见 [[67-df-provability-predicate]]；$g(\\bot)$ 是固定矛盾句 $\\bot\\equiv\\neg(0=0)$ 的编码，见 [[67-df-godel-encoding]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-godel-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"e5654af7c954e1c0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T$ 和 $\\mathrm{Prov}_T(v)$ 绑定同一有效呈示及表示公式，见 [[67-df-provability-predicate]]；$g(\\bot)$ 是固定矛盾句 $\\bot\\equiv\\neg(0=0)$ 的编码，见 [[67-df-godel-encoding]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2035a1f4d72e7df9","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$v\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{L_A}$，$P\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[v]$；$P[\\bar n/v]$ 为 [[67-df-formula]] 的无捕获代入。$\\mathrm{Con}_g(P)$ 显式保留表示公式参数；$\\mathrm{Con}_T$ 仅是固定 $\\mathrm{Prov}_T$ 后的简称。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"9f0e08fd1022847c","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"原书 p.13 定义 Con_σ，并在 p.14 指出对公理集的 PR binumeration 的选择存在记号省略。本条保留呈示依赖。量词 ∀p∈ℕ 是元语言量化，不能放进一个号称对象语言的句子定义；外部一致性仍见 [[67-df-consistent]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_T(v)","display":false},{"tex":"g(\\bot)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot\\equiv\\neg(0=0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline{g(\\bot)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_T","display":false},{"tex":"v\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"P\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[v]","display":false},{"tex":"P[\\bar n/v]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_g(P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_g(P)\\coloneqq\\neg P[\\overline{g(\\bot)}/v],\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Con}_T\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Con}_g(\\mathrm{Prov}_T).","display":true}],"bytes":2158,"backlinks":[{"id":"9f0e08fd1022847c","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"This predicate is used as an external hypothesis in incompleteness theorems; [[67-df-consistency-statement]] defines the corresponding internal sentence."},{"id":"141fe1f1e15dc325","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Con}_{A\\upharpoonright k}$ 为有限理论的一致性句，见 [[67-df-consistency-statement]]；有限公理集有标准有效证明检查式。"},{"id":"650dc4b8018183d7","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Con}_\\sigma$ 采用 [[67-df-formula-provability]] 的同一证明演算和 $\\mathrm{GRep}$ 图公式族；$v$ 为其指定的结论代码变量。有限 $F$ 的 $\\mathrm{Prov}_F$ 在下式固定为 $\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\sigma_F}$，并据此使用 [[67-df-consistency-statement]] 的 $\\mathrm{Con}_g$，不另选同外延表示。代码截断作用于公理，不作用于证明或定理集合。"},{"id":"f9e2ecde3df48a4b","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Prov}_\\sigma$、$\\mathrm{Con}_\\sigma$ 与加句公式取 [[67-df-formula-provability]]。在本条及其迭代中，$\\mathrm{Prov}_S=\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\sigma_S}$，$\\mathrm{Con}_S$ 以此表示绑定到 [[67-df-consistency-statement]]。"},{"id":"9c374139afcd5bf9","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$R$ 满足 [[67-df-rosser-sentence]] 的 $\\mathrm{Ros}_T(R)$；$\\mathrm{Prov}_T,\\mathrm{Con}_T$ 使用同一呈示，见 [[67-df-consistency-statement]]。"},{"id":"f79515ad9f47279a","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Con}_T$ 见 [[67-df-consistency-statement]]；固定 $G$ 满足 [[67-df-godel-sentence]] 的 $\\mathrm{Gdl}_T(G)$，标准 $\\Sigma_1$ 可证明性公式使该固定点为 $\\Pi_1$。"},{"id":"87f4e115bf0f1121","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Con}_T$ 见 [[67-df-consistency-statement]]；标准 $\\mathrm{Prov}_T$ 满足 [[67-df-provability-conditions]] 的 $\\mathrm{BL}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_T)$。固定点与 PA 分别见 [[67-thm-fixed-point-lemma]]、[[67-df-PA]]。"},{"id":"fbcaa556e59d96b1","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ea87f2f412f451b0","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}$ 采用固定 PR 呈示和标准证明算术化；$\\mathrm{Con}_T$ 取 [[67-df-consistency-statement]]。"},{"id":"0507b673d2cc3959","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$ 使用同一个标准有效呈示和证明表示；$\\mathrm{Prov}_T$、$\\mathrm{Con}_T$ 取 [[67-df-consistency-statement]]。"},{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-consistency-statement]]"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-consistency-statement]]"}],"outgoing":["2035a1f4d72e7df9","6a4c234306a0ec0c","e5654af7c954e1c0","9f0e08fd1022847c"]}